  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-view qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-eSIdh0SO\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">本章节主要介绍如何获取</span><a href=\"https://rubeex.oceanengine.com/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">Rubeex平台</a><span style=\"color: #333333;\">制作生成的互动作品详细信息：</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-ehm9iRuQ\"><strong>概念解释：</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-pkSqhVhM\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">互动作品：</span><a href=\"https://rubeex.oceanengine.com/\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">Rubeex平台</a><span style=\"color: #333333;\">制作生成的互动作品，系统标识为project id。</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-7LIaNX8A\"><span style=\"color: #333333;\">试玩素材：互动作品推送到AD营销投放平台，生成试玩素材，系统标识为playable id，project id和playable id是1对n 的关系。</span></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-4uSGKXdD\"><strong>核心接口：</strong></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-tjLPyJHk\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1701620909023236\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取作品信息</a><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1701620936632388\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取作品场景信息</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-piv4BPFV\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1701620989640707\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取作品版本信息</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-tgQFJ92Z\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1719937690024973\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取互动作品关联的试玩素材列表</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-nhDYus7M\"><a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/doc/index.html?key=ad&amp;type=api&amp;id=1719937796782094\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\" target=\"_blank\">获取试玩素材关联的营销计划列表</a></p><p data-id=\"p838747a-cJC10D2z\"></p></div>",
